Package: GEVStableGarch
Type: Package
Title: ARMA-GARCH/APARCH Models with Stable, GEV and GAt Innovations
Version: 2.0.0
Date: 2026-09-28
Authors@R: c(
    person("Thiago", "do Rego Sousa", role = c("aut", "cre"),
