Description: Simulation, estimation and forecasting of ARMA-GARCH/APARCH
    models with stable (S0 parametrization), generalized extreme value (GEV)
    and generalized asymmetric t (GAt) innovations. The innovation
    distribution is a pluggable object, so user defined densities get the
    same fitting, simulation, stationarity and forecasting machinery.
